  <name>z2rs</name>
  <summary>Clean-room reconstruction of Zelda II: The Adventure of Link</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      z2rs is a clean-room reconstruction of Zelda II: The Adventure of Link (NES),
      rewritten in Rust and checked frame by frame against the original game running
      in a reference emulator. You bring your own ROM — nothing from the original
      game is included.
    </p>
    <p>
      On top of the original game it adds widescreen with real scenery in the margins,
      HD graphics packs, two-player co-op on one machine or online, save states,
      fast-forward, movie playback, gamepad support, a randomizer that builds a new
      game from your ROM, and optional gameplay and display enhancements.
    </p>
  </description>
